  "question": {
    "text": "A solid cylinder is kept on one edge of a plank of same mass and length&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> placed on a smooth surface as shown in the figure. The coefficient of friction between the cylinder and the plank is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math>. The plank is given a velocity of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> towards right. Find the time (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>) after which plank and cylinder will separate. [<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>]<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0019_a6589473ae5c.jpg\" style=\"width: 295px; height: 109px;\" />"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Drawing free body diagram of the cylinder with respect to plank.<br/><br/> <math><mn>2</mn><mi>μ</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>μ</mi><mi>g</mi></math> <br/><br/> <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mo>;</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>μ</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> <br/><br/>Acceleration of point of contact with respect to plank is  <math><mn>4</mn><mi>μ</mi><mi>g</mi></math> <br/><br/>Velocity of pure rolling starts,<br/><br/> <math><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> <br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> <br/><br/>Distance traveled by cylinder with respect to plank in 1s is<br/><br/> <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&prime;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> <br/><br/>At  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> , the velocity of cylinder with respect to plank is<br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> <br/><br/> <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></math>  m/s<br/><br/>Remaining 10 m will be travelled in time  <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&prime;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> <br/><br/> <math><mo>∴</mo></math>  Total time = 2s"
  }
